# --------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable data, not source.
#
# data/raw/*.parquet is a straight pybaseball/Statcast download
# (regenerate with `python 01_download_baseline.py`); the raw
# season files alone run several hundred MB, well past what's
# reasonable to push to GitHub without Git LFS.
#
# data/cleaned/*.parquet is derived from data/raw (regenerate with
# `python 02_build_chase_dataset.py` and `python
# 03_build_run_value_tables.py`); baseline_chase_pitches.parquet alone is
# ~140MB, over GitHub's 100MB hard file-size limit.
#
# results/*.csv and results/*.png are kept out of this list on
# purpose -- they're small, and letting them stay tracked means
# anyone browsing the repo on GitHub can see the actual leaderboard
# and diagnostic plots without having to run anything first.
# --------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*.parquet
data/cleaned/*.parquet

# Local backup of the pre-methodology-change results, kept for my
# own before/after comparison. Not something anyone else needs.
archive/
